{"text":"It may be worth me mentioning at this moment that by some estimates, India is adding one million people per month to a population. As we sit here today, obviously against the backdrop of COP-27, I beg your pardon, we know that there are many, many tensions given the population size and population pressures that have continued to be placed on how to address climate change, and India is one country in particular where these issues have become very manifest, as we saw even last year with COP-26 in Glasgow. As I mentioned, it's not just the sheer quantity of the world's population that is growing. I should have said that the world's population, according to the United Nations, will continue to grow at a rapid clip until 2100, which is when we'll start to see a levelling off, and the estimates are that by demographers that will be at around 11 billion people at that time.","words":[{"text":"It","start":0.0,"end":0.78},{"text":"may","start":0.78,"end":1.0},{"text":"be","start":1.0,"end":1.2},{"text":"worth","start":1.2,"end":1.4},{"text":"me","start":1.4,"end":1.66},{"text":"mentioning","start":1.66,"end":2.14},{"text":"at","start":2.14,"end":2.62},{"text":"this","start":2.62,"end":2.86},{"text":"moment","start":2.86,"end":3.3},{"text":"that","start":3.3,"end":3.94},{"text":"by","start":3.94,"end":4.12},{"text":"some","start":4.12,"end":4.44},{"text":"estimates","start":4.44,"end":4.92,"punct":","},{"text":"India","start":5.18,"end":5.44},{"text":"is","start":5.44,"end":5.88},{"text":"adding","start":5.88,"end":6.3},{"text":"one","start":6.3,"end":6.64},{"text":"million","start":6.64,"end":6.94},{"text":"people","start":6.94,"end":7.52},{"text":"per","start":7.52,"end":8.1},{"text":"month","start":8.1,"end":8.46},{"text":"to","start":8.46,"end":9.04},{"text":"a","start":9.04,"end":9.16},{"text":"population","start":9.16,"end":9.68,"punct":"."},{"text":"As","start":10.76,"end":11.02},{"text":"we","start":11.02,"end":11.18},{"text":"sit","start":11.18,"end":11.4},{